  "conclusion": "Qwen3.6-35B-A3B-UD-Q5_K_M.gguf (24.64 GiB, hybrid-moe 35B/3B-active) ran with n_gpu_layers=999 and flash_attn=true on gfx1151 under both llama.cpp b8407 Vulkan and HIP/ROCm prebuilts (same commit 312cf03328496df9c56fe843952cf02a8964c59a). pp2048 median: Vulkan 675.98 t/s, HIP 625.84 t/s (HIP/Vulkan = 0.926). tg128 @ depth 4096 median: Vulkan 51.18 t/s, HIP 45.01 t/s (HIP/Vulkan = 0.880). Within-series variance <3% for every cell. No swap activity across 143 vmstat samples. RSS ~25 GiB for both backends. HIP uses 2-3x more User-CPU for the same throughput. Source-build path was not executed (cmake/HIP SDK unavailable in minimal ROCm user-space); prebuilt-toolchain confound explicitly documented.",
